      "value": "@{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}: 0 is normal iris as defined by the model creator. 40 is how I want my normal iris to be in game (and was working before 1088). 100 is huge iris like puppy eyes.  This isn't only affecting the iris blendshape but it's the most noticable one. There are a bunch for head fuzz that are getting set way higher in game than what they are set in unity, unless I set them to 0 in unity.",
      "viewerReactions": null
