      "value": "@{5f49f48a1070fd54aee975b0|full_name}: The more blendshape are active on a mesh. The more it will hit performence. \nIn your case you can make a new shape from mix with that shapekey set to 0.4. Then apply that one as basis. Redo your animation to compensate the change.",
